  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A cube of side 1.0 cm has a resistance between opposite sides of 50 Ω.</p>\n<p>The material is reshaped into a block of length 4.0 cm and constant square cross-section.</p>\n<p><figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure></p>\n<p>What is the resistance of the block between its square ends?<br/><br/></p>\n<p>[1]</p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\">3.1 Ω</li><li data-label=\"B\">50 Ω</li><li data-label=\"C\">800 Ω</li><li data-label=\"D\">3200 Ω</li></ol>"
  },
